     1.663      1.073         46        640: 96% ━━━━━━━━━━━╸ 106/110 7.0it/s 14.8s<0.6s', '\r        2/2      1.47G      1.406      1.528      1.662      1.074         29        640: 97% ━━━━━━━━━━━╸ 107/110 7.1it/s 14.9s<0.4s', '\r        2/2      1.47G      1.407      1.527      1.665      1.074         25        640: 98% ━━━━━━━━━━━╸ 108/110 7.2it/s 15.0s<0.3s', '\r        2/2      1.47G      1.406      1.527      1.664      1.073         39        640: 100% ━━━━━━━━━━━━ 110/110 7.3it/s 15.1s', '\r        2/2      1.47G      1.406      1.527      1.664      1.073         39        640: 100% ━━━━━━━━━━━━ 110/110 7.3it/s 15.1s', '\n', '\r                 Class     Images  Instances      Box(P          R      mAP50  mAP50-95)     Mask(P          R      mAP50  mAP50-95): 100% ━━━━━━━━━━━━ 1/1 14.7it/s 0.1s', '\r                 Class     Images  Instances      Box(P          R      mAP50  mAP50-95)     Mask(P          R      mAP50  mAP50-95): 100% ━━━━━━━━━━━━ 1/1 14.6it/s 0.1s', '\n', '                   all          8         38      0.818      0.472      0.641      0.335       0.75      0.474      0.648      0.234\n', '\n2 epochs completed in 0.009 hours.\n', 'Optimizer stripped from /yolo_runs/cell_seg_exp/weights/last.pt, 6.8MB\n', 'Optimizer stripped from /yolo_runs/cell_seg_exp/weights/best.pt, 6.8MB\n', '\nValidating /yolo_runs/cell_seg_exp/weights/best.pt...\n', 'Ultralytics 8.3.223 🚀 Python-3.12.8 torch-2.9.0+cu128 CUDA:0 (NVIDIA RTX 6000 Ada Generation, 48520MiB)\n', 'YOLOv8n-seg summary (fused): 85 layers, 3,258,259 parameters, 0 gradients, 11.3 GFLOPs\n', '\r                 Class     Images  Instances      Box(P          R      mAP50  mAP50-95)     Mask(P          R      mAP50  mAP50-95): 100% ━━━━━━━━━━━━ 1/1 7.6it/s 0.1s', '\r                 Class     Images  Instances      Box(P          R      mAP50  mAP50-95)     Mask(P          R      mAP50  mAP50-95): 100% ━━━━━━━━━━━━ 1/1 7.5it/s 0.1s', '\n', '                   all          8         38      